The fronts is a list of 1, 2, 4, 4, and 7.
The backs is a list of 1, 3, 4, 1, and 3.
The last is the last position of fronts.
The present is a list of 8 zeros.
The blocked is a list of 8 zeros.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The front is item spot of fronts.
The back is item spot of backs.
Set item front of present to 1.
Set item back of present to 1.
If front is back, set item front of blocked to 1.

The best is 100.
For every value from 0 to 7.
If item value of present is 1 and item value of blocked is 0 and value is less than best, set best to value.

If best is 100, show 0, otherwise show best.
